text:
Jefferies on GCPL
Buy, TP Rs 1400

current MD & CEO, Mr. Sudhir Sitapati, resigned with immediate effect in a surprising move

Board appointed Mr. Aasif Malbari, current CFO, as new MD & CEO and appointed Vishal Kedia as Interim CFO

Co held an investor call to address concerns surrounding resignation & discuss way forward, including new CEO's strategic priorities, which summarise below
a) stronger execution;
b) agility in decision-making;
c) getting core categories (HI & soaps) back on a growth trajectory while doubling down on newer categories/businesses;
d) volume-led growth across regions; e) conversion of top-line growth into profit growth over time
